| Vanilla Playwright                             | playwright-utils apiRequest                                                        |
| ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `const resp = await request.get('/api/users')` | `const { status, body } = await apiRequest({ method: 'GET', path: '/api/users' })` |
